<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav August wages rise 6.9 pct vs July.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav August wages rise 6.9 pct vs July.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV AVERAGE NET WAGES  AUG 96    JULY 96    AUG 1995</p>
<p> wage in dinars		    701	 656	   348</p>
<p> mth/mth pct change	     +6.9	+2.3	   +5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Data do not include private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
